@bryan-cmf/dsh-infra-observability README · Path A — Host composition (recommended, always-on)：Add to the profile's `package.json` `dsh.profile.bundles` (the package ships a
`dsh.bundle.patch` that inserts the plugin row):

```jsonc
"dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["@bryan-cmf/dsh-infra-observability"] } }
```
